Groups one or more partial reconciliations to represent a complete, balanced reconciliation between debit and credit journal items (e.g., invoice fully paid, bank line fully matched).
Key Functional Use Cases:

Mark invoices, bills, payments, or bank lines as fully reconciled
Link multiple partial payments to one invoice (or vice-versa)
Handle multi-currency full reconciliation with exchange rate gains/losses
Provide audit trail for complete matching of accounting entries
Used in reconciliation widget, aged receivables/payables, and financial reports
Cleanup of residual amounts when fully reconciled

Technical DNA:

Model Type: models.Model (persistent)
Key Fields:
name (char, sequenced)
partial_reconcile_ids → One2many to account.partial.reconcile
move_line_ids → Many2many to account.move.line (all reconciled lines)
currency_id, company_id
exchange_move_id (for forex gain/loss journal entry)
Computed: amount, reconciled_line_ids

Critical Hooks: create, _unlink_reconcile, action_open_reconcile
No direct state — existence of the record = fully reconciled
Security: Controlled via account.group_account_manager and move line rules

RAG Routing Keywords:
full reconcile, full reconciliation, complete reconciliation, fully reconciled, reconciled in full, reconciliation group, account.full.reconcile, residual cleared, zero residual, invoice fully paid, payment fully applied, matched completely
Related Models (most joined):

account.partial.reconcile (child lines)
account.move.line (via move_line_ids)
account.move / account.payment / account.bank.statement.line
account.account (through move lines)
res.currency (for exchange differences)

Ultra-Dense Vector Paragraph:
account.full.reconcile is the Odoo model that represents a complete balanced reconciliation by grouping multiple account.partial.reconcile records and linking all involved account.move.line with zero residual amount. It is created automatically when an invoice is fully paid, a bank statement line is fully matched, or manual reconciliation is completed, and handles multi-currency exchange differences. Core to Odoo’s reconciliation engine, audit trail, and financial closing processes.